                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10517' id='13' type-v2='text' w='49778' x='444' y='51074'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' underline='true'>REMARKS</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>Attribution Window : </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>30 days </run>
                    <run>Converted / activated users refer to users in either TG or CG who were activated within 3O days attribution window.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>- Cost per incr. Activation = fp-funded redemption voucher cost / activation uplift from voucher canvases</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>- ROI = Net GMV uplift from voucher canvases / fp-funded redemption voucher cost</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>For </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#fc0280' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>NCs, Prospect Registered</run>
                    <run> with 1st lifetime order conversion are used for uplift calculations. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>For </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#59a14f' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>NC reached AHA (5th order in the month), Welcome</run>
                    <run> canvases are used </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>For </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>Reactivated, Churn, Spark, Dormant, Reacquisition</run>
                    <run> canvases are used.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10517' id='307' type-v2='text' w='49333' x='50222' y='51074'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>For the </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>Grooming,</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Semibold'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>Active / Pre-churn / Pick-up / Demand Gen and Mature HVA</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#fc0280'>Æ </run>
                    <run>canvases are used.
- LC Uplift is calculated using Net GMV uplift.
- Net GMV Eur (Food) = Net GMV excluding acquisition and reactivation orders

For </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d37295' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>QC Trials</run>
                    <run fontname='Tableau Semibold'>, </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d37295' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>QC Trial, QC Trial Homescreen, QC Trial Homescreen Voucher Pack, Dmart Trial, Dmart Trial OTP, Shops Trial, Shops Trial OTP </run>
                    <run>canvases are used.&#10;For </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#76b7b2' fontname='Tableau Semibold'>pandapro, pandapro Trial, pandapro Churn and pandapro Missed Savings</run>
                    <run> canvases are included.
- Users refer to the</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#76b7b2'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#76b7b2'>monthly new subscriber signups</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#76b7b2'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555'>(new to platform + existing user but new to pro + resubscribers excluding renewals)</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='5000' id='415' mode='dropdown' name='LC Perf Tracking Graph' param='[federated.1ccvqz81ez35ej171el2u0wuldaj].[none:segment:nk]' show-all='false' type-v2='filter' values='relevant' w='49556' x='444' y='61600'>
