                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' underline='true'>REMARKS</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>The individual Retention Rate is calculated by</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#fc0280'>(users in the segment in the previous month &amp; Active in the reporting month) / (users in the segment in the previous month)</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>For example -</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#fc0280'>NC Retention Rate </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>refers to</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#fc0280'> % of NC users from previous month who are Active in the reporting month</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000'>, similarly for MAU/ EC/ Retained/ Reactivated Retention Rate</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                      <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                      <format attr='margin' value='4' />
